<title>CHINA: China 1996 wheat imports down by 28.8 pct.</title>
<headline>China 1996 wheat imports down by 28.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 8.25 million tonnes of wheat in 1996, down by 28.8 percent from 1995's 11.59 million tonnes, customs figures showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>China's wheat imports were 630,000 tonnes in December alone, the figures showed.</p>
</text>
